             TCP GRACEFUL TERMINATION

Client                                      Server
  |                                            |
  |                 FIN                        |
  |------------------------------------------->|
  |                                            |
  |                 ACK                        |
  |<-------------------------------------------|
  |                                            |
  |                                            |
  |                 FIN                        |
  |<-------------------------------------------|
  |                                            |
  |                 ACK                        |
  |------------------------------------------->|
  |                                            |
  |              CONNECTION CLOSED             |


FIN
↓
"I am finished sending."

ACK
↓
"I received that."

FIN
↓
"I am finished too."

ACK
↓
"Confirmed."
